  "en": "Where was that?",
  "cn": "在哪儿？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "en": "We had a summer house on Fire Island.",
  "cn": "我们在火岛有栋避暑别墅。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "en": "Do you remember, Michelle?",
  "cn": "你记得吗，Michelle？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "en": "Sure, you and mommy used to take me out of the ferry boat.",
  "cn": "你和妈妈以前带我坐渡轮。",
  "score": 0.74
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "en": "Sometimes at night, we would go down to the beach",
  "cn": "我们会到海滩上抓螃蟹，",
  "score": 0.59
 },
 {
  "i": 151,
  "en": "and catch crabs, remember?",
  "cn": "和抓螃蟹,记得?",
  "score": 0.3
 },
 {
  "i": 152,
  "en": "With the people who meet on the street.",
  "cn": "和这人们谁遇见在这街上.",
  "score": 0.3
 },
 {
  "i": 153,
  "en": "Right.",
  "cn": "对的.",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 154,
  "en": "Well, I think I'm going to go get us all some vegetables.",
  "cn": "嗯，我想去给我们拿些蔬菜来。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 155,
  "en": "Here you go.",
  "cn": "给您。",
  "score": 0.77
 },
 {
  "i": 156,
  "en": "And some ice-cold lemonade.",
  "cn": "还有冰镇的柠檬水。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 157,
  "en": "Enjoy it.",
  "cn": "慢用。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 158,
  "en": "Michelle, can I help you with the lemonade?",
  "cn": "Michelle，我帮你倒柠檬水好吗？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 159,
  "en": "No, thank you.",
  "cn": "不用，谢谢你。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 160,
  "en": "I'll wait for my father.",
  "cn": "我等我爸爸。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 161,
  "en": "Michelle, can we have a talk?",
  "cn": "Michelle，我们能聊聊吗？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 162,
  "en": "Sure.",
  "cn": "当然.",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 163,
  "en": "I know you miss your mother.",
  "cn": "我知道",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 164,
  "en": "You do?",
  "cn": "是吗？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 165,
  "en": "Yes, and I'm not trying to take her place.",
  "cn": "是的，我不是想取代她。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 166,
  "en": "Then why are you and Daddy spending so much time together?",
  "cn": "总待在一起？",
  "score": 0.6
 },
 {
  "i": 167,
  "en": "Because we like each other.",
  "cn": "因为我们互相喜欢。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 168,
  "en": "And right now, he needs a friend.",
  "cn": "而现在，他需要一个朋友。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 169,
  "en": "I'm his friend.",
  "cn": "我是他的朋友。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 170,
  "en": "I know you are.",
  "cn": "我知道",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 171,
  "en": "Sometimes he's very sad.",
  "cn": "有时候他很伤心。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 172,
  "en": "And so are you, I think.",
  "cn": "我想你也是。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 173,
  "en": "Sometimes.",
  "cn": "有时候。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 174,
  "en": "I'd like to be your friend, too.",
  "cn": "我也想做你的朋友。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 175,
  "en": "Will you let me be your friend, Michelle?",
  "cn": "你会",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 176,
  "en": "So what were you two talking about?",
  "cn": "你们俩在聊什么？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 177,
  "en": "Just girl talk, Daddy.",
  "cn": "女孩间的悄悄话，爸爸。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 178,
  "en": "It's too hard to explain.",
  "cn": "太难解释了。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 179,
  "en": "Probably right.",
  "cn": "你可能是对的。",
  "score": 0.75
 },
 {
  "i": 180,
  "en": "Well, let's get started.",
  "cn": "嗯，开始吃吧。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 181,
  "en": "Quarter to four, and I have a production meeting at four.",
  "cn": "我四点还有个生产会议。",
  "score": 0.82
 },
 {
  "i": 182,
  "en": "I plan to take you for a ride in Central Park",
  "cn": "我本打算带你去中央公园",
  "score": 0.91
 },
 {
  "i": 183,
  "en": "in a horse and carriage.",
  "cn": "坐马车兜风。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 184,
  "en": "Harry, I'd love to, but I have work to do.",
  "cn": "但我有工作要做。",
  "score": 0.69
 },
 {
  "i": 185,
  "en": "OK, we'll walk back to your office with you.",
  "cn": "好，我们陪你走回办公室。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 186,
  "en": "So nice out.",
  "cn": "外面天气真好。",
  "score": 0.79
 },
 {
  "i": 187,
  "en": "I decided to forget about my accounting problems",
  "cn": "我决定忘掉会计上的问题，",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 188,
  "en": "and just enjoy this beautiful spring day.",
  "cn": "就享受这个美丽的春日。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 189,
  "en": "Take the time, Susan.",
  "cn": "抽出点时间吧，Susan。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 190,
  "en": "I know I should, but, well, there",
  "cn": "我知道",
  "score": 0.6
 },
 {
  "i": 191,
  "en": "are too many things to do.",
  "cn": "但……嗯，要做的事太多了。",
  "score": 0.73
 },
 {
  "i": 192,
  "en": "I understand.",
  "cn": "我理解.",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 193,
  "en": "I'll go for the ride with Michelle.",
  "cn": "我带 Michelle 去兜风。",
  "score": 0.86
 },
 {
  "i": 194,
  "en": "Right.",
  "cn": "对的.",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 195,
  "en": "Well, I had a really nice time.",
  "cn": "嗯，我过得真的很开心。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 196,
  "en": "So did I.",
  "cn": "我也是。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 197,
  "en": "So did I. I'm sorry you can't come with us, Susan.",
  "cn": "对不起",
  "score": 0.83
 },
 {
  "i": 198,
  "en": "So am I.",
  "cn": "我也是。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 199,
  "en": "Michelle, can you wait till I make a phone call?",
  "cn": "Harry！Michelle！能等一下我打个电话吗？",
  "score": 0.93
 },
 {
  "i": 200,
  "en": "Sure.",
  "cn": "当然.",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 201,
  "en": "Susan Stewart's office.",
  "cn": "Susan Stewart 办公室。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 202,
  "en": "Sam, this is Susan.",
  "cn": "Sam，我是 Susan。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 203,
  "en": "Hi, how was lunch?",
  "cn": "嗨，午餐怎么样？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 204,
  "en": "Fine.",
  "cn": "很好。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 205,
  "en": "You're late.",
  "cn": "你迟到了。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 206,
  "en": "The production department's waiting in the conference room.",
  "cn": "生产部在会议室等你。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 207,
  "en": "I know.",
  "cn": "我知道.",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 208,
  "en": "Ask Paul Smith to fill in for me.",
  "cn": "让 Paul Smith 代替我。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 209,
  "en": "He knows everything about the production schedule,",
  "cn": "他对生产日程了如指掌，",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 210,
  "en": "and he can answer any questions.",
  "cn": "能回答任何问题。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 211,
  "en": "Right.",
  "cn": "对的.",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 212,
  "en": "Don't tell anyone, but I'm taking a little time",
  "cn": "我要抽点时间闻闻花香。",
  "score": 0.54
 },
 {
  "i": 213,
  "en": "to smell the flowers.",
  "cn": "去闻这花.",
  "score": 0.3
 },
 {
  "i": 214,
  "en": "Good for you.",
  "cn": "做得好。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 215,
  "en": "It'll be our secret.",
  "cn": "这是我们俩的秘密。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 216,
  "en": "But schedule another production meeting for tomorrow.",
  "cn": "但请安排明天再开一次生产会议。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 217,
  "en": "I'll be back for my 6 o'clock appointment",
  "cn": "赴六点和小泽先生的约。",
  "score": 0.51
 },
 {
  "i": 218,
  "en": "with Mr. Ozawa.",
  "cn": "和先生.Ozawa.",
  "score": 0.3
 },
 {
  "i": 219,
  "en": "OK, Susan, and have a nice afternoon.",
  "cn": "祝你下午愉快。",
  "score": 0.79
 },
 {
  "i": 220,
  "en": "Thanks.",
  "cn": "谢谢.",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 221,
  "en": "How'd you do it?",
  "cn": "你怎么做到的？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 222,
  "en": "About what?",
  "cn": "聊什么？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 223,
  "en": "Life.",
  "cn": "人生。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 224,
  "en": "And what'd you decide?",
  "cn": "那你们得出什么结论？",
  "score": 0.75
 },
 {
  "i": 225,
  "en": "That's a secret between us women.",
  "cn": "那是秘密……我们女人之间的秘密。",
  "score": 1.0
 }
]